## Safety rules

- Never write to live router/modem unless the Linear issue explicitly approves it with mode `live-change`
- Never commit secrets, tokens, API keys, private notes, or device captures
- Always update `CFW3212_JTOOLEY_CHANGELOG.md` with the exact new tag before triggering a package build
- Work tree directories (`qmanager_work_v*/`) are generated — edit templates and converter instead

